{"id": "t142-002", "text": "Coffee with Duc and Ioana. Duc's moving to Leeds sometime in the spring, no firm date yet. Ioana has her citizenship test on 3rd of March 2027 and says she's revising every evening. She's vegetarian now too, apparently since the summer. Duc's partner hasn't found a job up there yet, so it might slip to the autumn. We said we'd do a leaving meal before he goes, probably early March.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "citizenship test", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of March 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "to the autumn", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving meal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before he goes", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t142-004", "text": "Rang Mum's friend Suzanne back. Her grandson's results day is 13 August so she'll know about uni then. She's still doing the allotment, mostly beans and courgettes this year.", "spans": [{"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "friend", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "owner": "r1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandson", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results day", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "13 August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "allotment", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}]}
{"id": "t142-005", "text": "Saw Gareth at the station. He's finally sitting the CFA exams in March 2027, the firm's paying. Seemed relaxed about it, says he's done the first two levels already and this is the last one. They've got a study room set up in the loft now. His wife Bridget is expecting in the new year, due around late January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "CFA exams", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relaxed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "study room set up in the loft", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bridget", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "around late January", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t142-009", "text": "Mariam Kowalski from work, goes by Mari. Starts her MSc part time in January 2027. Loves bouldering, does it three nights a week. Allergic to nuts, worth remembering for the Christmas do.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam Kowalski", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mari", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MSc", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Allergic to nuts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christmas do", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t142-012", "text": "Dinner at Ali and Shanice's. Their daughter has her grade 5 piano exam on 21st of November and has been practising nonstop. Shanice says she cries every time she gets the scales wrong. Ali has a new job at the council starting 4 January. Their dog Biscuit is still eating socks. Don't forget to send Ali congrats properly, I only said it in passing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 5 piano exam", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21st of November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cries every time she gets the scales wrong", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "4 January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Ali congrats properly", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t142-018", "text": "Andile messaged. His bar exam results come out 28 October and he can't sleep. His girlfriend has been keeping him busy with films. Must ring him on the 28th, whatever happens.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bar exam results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "28 October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't sleep", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t142-020", "text": "Anil's son did his eleven plus last week. Results not till 1 March 2027. Anil seemed more nervous than the kid. Ask him about it then.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eleven plus", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Results", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till 1 March 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kid", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t142-021", "text": "Long chat with Tobi. He's leaving the bank at the end of the year to retrain as an electrician. Course starts sometime in January, assessments every few months. He's got a cat now, Pepper, rescue. Said the flat is too small for the two of them. Lives in Walthamstow still. His brother Dawit is getting married 8th of August 2027, Tobi's best man and terrified of the speech.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "retrain as an electrician", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Course", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every few months"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat is too small", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "Lives in Walthamstow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "8th of August 2027", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "best man", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}]}
{"id": "t142-024", "text": "Ivan rang. Medical school interview at Edinburgh on 9 December, and another at King's in the new year. Really wants Edinburgh. I said I'd do a mock with him next weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Medical school interview at Edinburgh", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "another at King's", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants Edinburgh", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t142-026", "text": "Bumped into Caitlin Brennan and her husband in Sainsbury's. They're taking the kids to Disneyland Paris at Easter. Caitlin's back at uni finishing her teaching qualification, placement till June. She looked shattered.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin Brennan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Disneyland Paris", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Easter", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "back at uni", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "teaching qualification", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "placement", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till June", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "shattered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t142-028", "text": "Chioma failed again, the roundabout thing. Gutted. She says she's not booking another until spring. I need to take her out for a drink soon and not mention cars.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "failed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until spring"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for a drink", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t142-030", "text": "Dawit says the wedding venue is booked, 8 August 2027 in Addis. He and his fiancée want everyone there a week early. Need to look at flights after Christmas when prices drop.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "8 August 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiancée", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week early", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "look at flights", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when prices drop", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t142-032", "text": "Lindiwe has her NMC test in October 2027, her first proper exam in years. Matteo says she's already making flashcards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "NMC test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in October 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t142-040", "text": "Gareth and Bridget had the baby early, 3 January, little girl called Nia. Both doing well. Must sort a present and a card this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bridget", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing well", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a present and a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t142-044", "text": "My own plan for the new year: sign up for the Spanish B1 exam in June, maybe the 7th. Start classes after Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the new year"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sign up for the Spanish B1 exam", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Spanish B1 exam", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 7th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Start classes", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t142-049", "text": "Ignacio passed the coaching assessment, now UEFA C licensed. Starting with the under 12s in September.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ignacio", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coaching assessment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "UEFA C licensed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "under 12s", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t142-050", "text": "Book flights for Dawit's wedding: arrive by 1 August 2027, back around the 12th. Check visa rules first.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Book flights for Dawit's wedding", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 1 August 2027", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "around the 12th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check visa rules", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "first", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t142-052", "text": "Tobi's course started. He said the first practical assessment is 20/03 and he's nervous because he's the oldest there. Pepper is fine, knocked a plant over. I should send him a message the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "course", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first practical assessment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "20/03", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "oldest there", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t142-054", "text": "Lunch with Suzanne, Gareth and the baby. Nia's christening is 14 May at St Mary's. Bridget is back at work in September. Suzanne kept saying she wants to go to Iceland, maybe next autumn, for her 65th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bridget", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to go to Iceland", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next autumn", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "65th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}]}
{"id": "t142-055", "text": "Mari passed her resit!! She's moving onto the dissertation over the summer. Need to take her out for dinner to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mari", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "resit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dissertation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for dinner to celebrate", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t142-057", "text": "Anil's son got into the grammar school. Anil was emotional on the phone. They're doing a little family dinner on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grammar school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "emotional", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little family dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t142-058", "text": "Caitlin finished her placement, qualified teacher from 1 September. She's applying for jobs in Kent. Her husband's not keen on moving though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "placement", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "qualified teacher", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 1 September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not keen on moving", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t142-060", "text": "Ivan heard nothing from Edinburgh yet, should be sometime in February or March. King's interview was 15/01 and he thinks it went okay. His mum keeps asking him every day which isn't helping. I need to check in with Ivan next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in February or March"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "King's interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "15/01", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every day"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with Ivan", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
